Explain the engine verification result below to the user in {{locale}}. State what changed, which checks ran, which passed or failed and what remains unresolved. Reproduce the engine's status without upgrading unknown, cancelled or failed to success. State when an external integration or manual test is still required.

USER NOTE (may be empty):
{{note}}

ENGINE VERIFICATION RESULT (authoritative):
{{engine_verification_result}}

Return JSON with exactly these fields: engine_status (copied verbatim from the result's status field), summary (string), completed_checks (array of strings), unresolved (array of strings), next_action (string).
